    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d278">

                <pb facs="0645" n="607" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv11/pg607"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 811.001/338</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Armenian National Delegation to the Commission to
                        Negotiate Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-04">July 4, 1919</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gentlemen</hi>: I have the honour to enclose herewith
                    a message to President Wilson signed by Mr. Veniselos, Mr. Pashitch, Dr. Benes,
                        <pb facs="0646" n="608" xml:id="pg608"/> Boghos Nubar Pasha and Mr.
                        Sokolow,<anchor n="65" xml:id="d278-f1"/> which I shall feel greatly obliged
                    if you will kindly transmit to His Excellency by wireless at your earliest
                    convenience.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James A. Malcolm</hi></signed><lb/>For
                    the Armenian National Delegation</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d278-f1" n="65" xml:id="d278-f1-content">
                <p>Representatives of the Greek, Jugoslav, Czechoslovak, Armenian, and Zionist
                    delegations, respectively.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
